{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q418850","formula":"C₁₆H₁₁ClN₂O₃","hill":"C16H11ClN2O3","elements":["H","C","N","O","Cl"],"composition":{"C":16.0,"H":11.0,"N":2.0,"O":3.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"Clorazepic acid","ru":"Клоразепат"},"descriptions":{"en":"Clorazepate, sold under the brand name Tranxene among others, is a benzodiazepine medication. It possesses anxiolytic, anticonvulsant, sedative, hypnotic, and skeletal muscle relaxant properties. Clorazepate is an unusually long-lasting benzodiazepine and serves as a prodrug for the equally long-lasting desmethyldiazepam, which is rapidly produced as an active metabolite.","ru":"Клоразепа́т — лекарственное средство из группы бензодиазепинов. Оказывает анксиолитическое (противотревожное), противосудорожное, седативное, снотворное и миорелаксирующее действие. Клоразепат является пролекарством, которое в организме быстро превращается в активный метаболит — нордазепам."},"fame":27,"pubchemCid":2809,"mass":314.72,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=CC=C(C=C1)C2=NC(C(=O)NC3=C2C=C(C=C3)Cl)C(=O)O","inchikey":"XDDJGVMJFWAHJX-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"7-chloro-2-oxo-5-phenyl-1,3-dihydro-1,4-benzodiazepine-3-carboxylic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"2809","atoms":33,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":3.224,"y":-3.397,"z":-1.51,"el":"Cl"},{"x":-3.482,"y":-0.13,"z":1.591,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.448,"y":0.57,"z":-1.043,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.128,"y":2.427,"z":-0.97,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.691,"y":-1.497,"z":1.216,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.028,"y":1.079,"z":-0.212,"el":"N"},{"x":0.34,"y":-0.974,"z":-0.126,"el":"C"},{"x":0.121,"y":0.504,"z":-0.102,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.486,"y":-1.862,"z":0.58,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.21,"y":0.266,"z":-0.409,"el":"C"},{"x":1.297,"y":1.399,"z":0.094,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.512,"y":-0.435,"z":0.895,"el":"C"},{"x":1.478,"y":-1.463,"z":-0.789